      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `query_error_logs.py` that queries recent error log entries filtered by severity and time range using a concrete external provider, I will use the AWS CloudWatch service. This service allows for querying log groups, which can be used to filter logs by severity and time range. The provider will be identifiable in the code through the use of the `boto3` library, which is the AWS SDK for Python, and the specific AWS service endpoint for CloudWatch Logs. </thinking>\n",
